 en:'Fresh bite marks edge the tender leaves.|Cracked husks dot the feeding trail.|Sweet juice stains the resting place.|Silver scales glint beside the tracks.|Tiny paws bend the low green blades.|Damp footprints lead to a rippling surface.|Claw marks spiral up a tall trunk.|Sun warmth lingers on a broad flat slab.|Its short shadow sits beneath a bright sky.|It appears as the sky turns rose and shadows stretch.|It emerges beneath distant lights after the sun is gone.|Sudden movement sends this shy friend away.|It watches your open palm with curiosity.|Its ears follow a soft repeating melody.',
